    ["<Highlight>工坊建造</>\n玩家可以通过<Highlight>指派雇员</>来建造工坊。\n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>1、雇员建造速度</>\n指派雇员<Highlight>数量越多</>，建造速度越快；指派雇员<Highlight>稀有度越高</>，建造速度越快。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>2、秘偶幻化 【推荐】</>\n星虫可以<Highlight>幻化成其他玩家</>，指派幻化后的星虫进行建造，<Highlight>建造速度会大幅度提升</>。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>3、建造速度上限</>\n每个工坊存在<Highlight>建造速度上限</>，达到上限后继续指派雇员不会提升建造速度。"] = "<Highlight>Workshop Construction</>\nPlayers can build workshops by <Highlight>assigning employees</>. \n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>1. Employee construction speed </>\nThe more <Highlight>employees assigned</>, the faster the construction speed; the higher the <Highlight>rarity of the assigned employees</>, the faster the construction speed. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>2. Marionette Illusion [Recommended] </>\nStar Insects can <Highlight>transform into other players</>. Assigning transformed Star Insects to build will <Highlight>significantly increase construction speed</>. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>3. Construction speed limit </>\nEach workshop has a <Highlight>construction speed limit</>. After reaching the limit, assigning more employees will not increase the construction speed.",
